{
  "version": 1,
  "note": "STARTER LIST. Written by an engineer, not a lawyer: have it reviewed for each country before launch. 'block' stops a listing in the app; 'warn' shows a notice and lets the person continue. Both are also flagged for moderators by the moderate-listing function. Keywords are matched as whole words after Arabic spellings are folded together (see lib/arabic.ts).",
